Themes (src/themes.js)
Both themes are unofficial fan tributes. They are not affiliated with or
endorsed by Nujabes's estate, Hydeout Productions, Ye (Kanye West), Takashi
Murakami, or any rights holder. No album art, logos or lyrics are included.

- Nujabes (src/themes.js): the palette and the line "Your beat still laments
  the world." are adapted from HalmyLyseas/omarchy-nujabes-theme,
  Copyright (c) 2026 Halmyrach. MIT License, below. ANSI blue and the dim colour
  were lightened for contrast. The wallpaper and kana art in that repo carry no
  licence and are not used.
- Ye: Graduation (src/themes.js): the palette is original. The lines are a
  curated part of the list in ajzbc/kanye.rest, Copyright (c) 2024 Andrew Jazbec.
  MIT License, below. That licence covers the compilation. The words are
  attributed to Ye and remain his.

